 "category_zh": "山地风光",
 "category_en": "Mountain scenery",
 "intro_zh": "净月潭景区是国家级风景名胜区、国家森林公园。净月潭形状如弯月，含沙净水，拥有着独特风光，是山峦环绕草木茂密的水库型游览区。景区具有冬雪夏爽的特征，拥有集湖、林、山、田于一体的独特风貌。",
 "intro_en": "Jingyuetan Scenic Area is a national scenic spot and a national forest park. Jingyuetan is shaped like a crescent moon, contains sand and pure water, and has unique scenery. It is a reservoir-shaped tourist area surrounded by mountains and dense vegetation. The scenic spot has the characteristics of snow in winter and coolness in summer, and has a unique style integrating lakes, forests, mountains and fields.",
 "intro_en_source": "machine_translation",
